{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2022-03-14 09:05:00', 'title': 'SYNOPSYS STREAMLINES OPTICAL PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT WITH NEW INTEROPERABILITY BETWEEN CODE V AND LIGHTTOOLS', 'text': 'NEW CAPABILITIES LINK INDUSTRY-LEADING IMAGING AND ILLUMINATION DESIGN TOOLS FOR FASTER MULTI-DOMAIN OPTICAL SIMULATIONS\xa0 MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF. , MARCH 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SYNOPSYS, INC. (NASDAQ:\xa0SNPS)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THE AVAILABILITY OF NEW AND IMPROVED INTEROPERABILITY FEATURES BETWEEN CODE V® AND LIGHTTOOLS®, WHICH ENABLE DESIGNERS TO EASILY SIMULATE OPTICAL SYSTEMS THAT CONTAIN IMAGING AND NON-IMAGING COMPONENTS, THEREBY REDUCING PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT TIME.'}